"tr":"walā","l":4,"g":[["وَ","REM","prefix","w:REM"],["لَا","NEG","stem",""]]},{"i":"2:141:12","a":"تُسْـَٔلُونَ","t":"you will be asked","p":"V","tr":"tus'alūna","f":["IMPF","PASS","2MP"],"r":86,"l":105,"g":[["تُسْـَٔلُ","V","stem","IMPF|PASS|2MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:2MP"]]},{"i":"2:141:13","a":"عَمَّا","t":"about what","p":"P","tr":"ʿammā","l":21,"g":[["عَ","P","stem",""],["مَّا","REL","stem",""]]},{"i":"2:141:14","a":"كَانُوا۟","t":"they used to","p":"V","tr":"kānū","f":["PERF","3MP"],"r":2,"l":9,"g":[["كَانُ","V","stem","PERF|3MP"],["وا","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"2:141:15","a":"يَعْمَلُونَ","t":"do","p":"V","tr":"yaʿmalūna","f":["IMPF","3MP"],"r":18,"l":44,"g":[["يَعْمَلُ","V","stem","IMPF|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"e":"١٤١","v":"2:141"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"2:135","t":"They say, \"Be Jews or Christians [so] you will be guided.\" Say, \"Rather, [we follow] the religion of Abraham, inclining toward truth, and he was not of the polytheists.\"","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":135,"sd":null},{"k":"2:136","t":"Say, [O believers], \"We have believed in Allāh and what has been revealed to us and what has been revealed to Abraham and Ishmael and Isaac and Jacob and the Descendants [al-Asbāṭ] and what was given to Moses and Jesus and what was given to the prophets from their Lord. We make no distinction between any of them, and we are Muslims [in submission] to Him.\"","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":136,"sd":null},{"k":"2:137","t":"So if they believe in the same as you believe in, then they have been [rightly] guided; but if they turn away, they are only in dissension, and Allāh will be sufficient for you against them. And He is the Hearing, the Knowing.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":137,"sd":null},{"k":"2:138","t":"[And say, \"Ours is] the religion of Allāh. And who is better than Allāh in [ordaining] religion? And we are worshippers of Him.\"","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":138,"sd":null},{"k":"2:139","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Do you argue with us about Allāh while He is our Lord and your Lord? For us are our deeds, and for you are your deeds. And we are sincere [in deed and intention] to Him.\"","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":139,"sd":null},{"k":"2:140","t":"Or do you say that Abraham and Ishmael and Isaac and Jacob and the Descendants were Jews or Christians? Say, \"Are you more knowing or is Allāh?\" And who is more unjust than one who conceals a testimony he has from Allāh? And Allāh is not unaware of what you do.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":140,"sd":null},{"k":"2:141","t":"That is a nation which has passed on. It will have [the consequence of] what it earned, and you will have what you have earned. And you will not be asked about what they used to do.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":141,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":2,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}